\[
180 \, \text{miles} - 15 \, \text{miles} = 165 \, \text{miles}
\]

#### Part 3: Time spent driving at 80 mph (1.5 hours).
Finally, John drives at a speed of 80 mph for the remaining 1.5 hours. The distance covered is:

