\]

After this segment, John has reduced the distance to home by 120 miles. He is now:

\[
165 \, \text{miles} - 120 \, \text{miles} = 45 \, \text{miles}
\]

---

### Final Answer:
At the end of the 4-hour return trip, John is **45 miles away from home**.

