\]

### Step 2: Calculate the monthly charge for the second half of the year
For the second half of the year, Aleena was charged 10% less than $140 per month. To calculate the discounted monthly charge:
\[
10\% \text{ of } 140 = 0.10 \times 140 = 14
\]
\[
\text{Discounted monthly charge} = 140 - 14 = 126
\]

### Step 3: Calculate the amount paid for the second half of the year
