### Step 3: Account for the number of turtles.
The number of turtles (4) does not affect the time it takes for each turtle to cross the highway because they are traveling independently. Each turtle will still take 36 hours to cross the highway.
The time it will take for four turtles to cross the highway is **36 hours**.
